desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.water_cooling=使用水冷却机枪,增加机枪能承受的最大热量.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.heavy_barrel=显著提高射速,会导致更高的后坐力和更快的过热速度.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.second_magazine=允许同时使用两个弹匣中的弹药,需要单独重新装填.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.belt_fed_loader=允许使用玩家下方弹药箱中的弹药,增加部署时间.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.precise_bipod=增加部署时间,减小后坐力.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.hasty_bipod=减少部署时间,增加后坐力
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.scope=提供远距离瞄准视野.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.infrared_scope=提供清晰的夜间视野,需要电源,例如电容器背包.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.shield=抵挡投射物并保护射手免受近战伤害,增加部署时间.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.tripod=几乎去除后坐力,增大瞄准角度并增加部署时间.

desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.sturdy_barrel=增加弹速与穿透力,降低射速.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.suppressor=降低枪响,以便进行快速且隐蔽的行动.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.bottom_loading=更换握把使枪变为由下方装弹并兼容弹鼓.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.folding_stock=增加装填速度与瞄准速度,降低移动时的精准度.

desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.heavy_springbox=增加弹速与穿透力,降低射速.

desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.rifle_grenade_launcher=允许发射磁轨炮榴弹,但射程远低于磁轨炮.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.stereoscopic_rangefinder=显示与目标的距离,配合无线电信标可以通过数据发送敌人的位置.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.gyroscopic_stabilizer=在射击后自动稳定枪械,降低所有开火模式的后坐力,需要电力.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.electric_firing_motor=在全自动开火模式下增加射速,需要电力.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.railgun_assisted_chamber=在手动射击模式下增加弹速,需要电力.

desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.semi_automatic=允许通过弹匣装填,增加射速.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.extended_barrel=在手动射击模式下增加弹速,降低射速.

desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.gasmask=保护使用者免受有害气体伤害.

desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.infiltrator_gear=提供夜视与变焦视野,使用需要电力.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.technician_gear=显示通常需要手持工程师锤,扳手或电表才能显示的信息,使用需要电力.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.engineer_gear=将渗透者面罩与技师面罩的功能结合,但能源消耗也增大了.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.steel_armor_plates=略微增加装甲厚度,可以反弹箭和其他轻型投射物,每件装甲最多可安装3个.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.composite_armor_plates=显著增加装甲厚度,当敌人近战武器不能穿透装甲时,可以反弹投射物与近战伤害.每件装甲最多可安装3个.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.hazmat_coating=使装甲可以防御辐射与腐蚀性物质.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.heat_resistant_coating=配合靴子加强件使用可以在高温流体中游泳.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.anti_static_mesh=使穿戴者免疫电击且无法被特斯拉线圈瞄准,但对水下的电流非常敏感.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.camouflage_mesh=使穿戴者在靠近树叶时隐形,但对火极其敏感.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.infrared_absorbing_mesh=使穿戴者对红外设备隐形,但对EMP极其敏感.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.scuba_tank=配合防毒面具可在装满氧气后在水下呼吸.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.helipack=允许缓慢且稳定的飞行,消耗汽油.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.exoskeleton=允许更快的奔跑,使用时消耗电力.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.boot_reinforcement=使穿戴者免疫火焰伤害,配合耐热覆层使用可以在高温流体中游泳.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.snow_rackets=增加在雪地的移动速度与在冰上的稳定性.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.flippers=增加在水下的移动速度.
desc.immersiveintelligence.toolupgrade.internal_springs=使穿戴者免疫摔落伤害,并使脚步静音.

