skin.immersiveintelligence.pershing.text=An America themed skin granted for helping to fix 6 or more bugs.

skin.immersiveintelligence.zvezda.name=Zvezda
skin.immersiveintelligence.zvezda.desc=Nu... Poehali!
skin.immersiveintelligence.zvezda.text=A Soviet themed skin granted for contributors to translation and international promotion of the mod.

skin.immersiveintelligence.vaterland.name=Vaterland
skin.immersiveintelligence.vaterland.desc=An Iron Cross
skin.immersiveintelligence.vaterland.text=A Germany themed skin.

#Machine Upgrades
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.inserter=物品抓取机械臂
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.inserter.desc=在储存箱中添加机械臂,可以在供电的情况下在3格的半径内自动操作.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.mg_loader=连续装弹机
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.mg_loader.desc=扩大弹药舱可以在经过一些修改后直接将子弹送入机关枪,储存箱必须打开才能提供弹药.。

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.sovereignty=主权
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.sovereignty.desc=允许该建筑为其所属的派系控制周围地形.

#Sawmill
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.improved_gearbox=改进齿轮箱
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.improved_gearbox.desc=将原装变速箱更换为改进型号会显著提高机器速度,同时增加操作所需的能量.
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.saw_unregulator=调节锯
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.saw_unregulator.desc=调节锯以获得更高的锯末产出,但减少主要产物.

#Flagpole
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.flagpole.capture_defiance=反占领
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.flagpole.capture_defiance.desc=强化旗杆,提高其结构完整性以及主动占领所需的部队数量.
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.flagpole.taser_locks=泰瑟锁
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.flagpole.taser_locks.desc=增加一个防御特斯拉线圈,会攻击试图夺取旗杆的敌人.
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.flagpole.distress_signal=求救信号
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.flagpole.distress_signal.desc=添加一个无线电连接的警报器,当敌方部队靠近时会启动.
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.flagpole.unit_post=单位岗位
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.flagpole.unit_post.desc=允许组成分配到此旗杆的步兵排

#Emplacement
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.sturdy_bearings=坚固轴承
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.sturdy_bearings.desc=更高质量的轴承可以提高武器的最大旋转速度.
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.emergency_smoke=应急发烟器
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.emergency_smoke.desc=当武器站的武器严重受损时,会排出烟雾以提供掩护.
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.targetting=增强型锁定系统
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.targetting.desc=改进的火控系统可以更好地获取和跟踪目标,提高准确性.

#Emplacement Weapons
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.infrared_observer=红外观察器
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.infrared_observer.desc=红外观察器可以监视远处的敌人,并通过数据线缆发送他们的坐标.
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.spotlight_tower=聚光灯塔
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.spotlight_tower.desc=聚光塔能够照亮敌方单位,使其迷惑,并提高友军单位的准确度.
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.searchlight=探照灯
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.searchlight.desc=探照灯与雷达,红外观察器或聚光灯塔协同工作,使敌方单位迷失方向,并提高友军火力的命中率.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.cpds=CPDS
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.cpds.desc=反投射物防御系统(Counter-Projectile Defense System)是一种先进的防空武器,能够在半空中摧毁来袭的炮弹.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.autocannon=机炮
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.autocannon.desc=四门3bCal机炮提供了优异的火力,使该武器成为可对抗空中和地面目标的通用防御武器.
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.heavy_chemthrower=重型化学喷射器
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.heavy_chemthrower.desc=经典化学喷射器的重型版本,重量更重压力更高,具有便携式版本四倍的有效距离.
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.heavy_railgun=重型磁轨炮
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.heavy_railgun.desc=重型磁轨炮可以提供直接火力支援,以高速的金属棒或磁轨炮榴弹刺穿敌人或设施.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.machinegun=机枪巢
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.machinegun.desc=机枪巢可以提供压制性的自动射击,适合用以压制成群的敌人.由于其结构所限,它无法攻击空中目标.
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.machinegun.heavy_barrel=重型枪管
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.machinegun.heavy_barrel.desc=重型枪管提供更高的射速,同时略微增加能承受的最大热量.
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.machinegun.watercooled=水冷枪管
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.machinegun.watercooled.desc=替换原装枪管。安装后，在提供冷却液的情况下，枪管不会过热。
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.machinegun.additional_fortifications=附加防御工事
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.machinegun.additional_fortifications.desc=在机枪巢周围放置额外的沙袋可以为其提供额外的装甲并提高其耐用性.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.mortar=迫击炮
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.mortar.desc=迫击炮在近距离提供间接火力支持,高抛弹道和大口径炮弹使其能够穿透屋顶并从上方摧毁敌人.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.light_howitzer=轻型火炮
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.light_howitzer.desc=轻型火炮在中程提供间接火力支援,其机动性使其能够快速精确地攻击敌方阵地.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.rocket_launcher=火箭发射器
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.rocket_launcher.desc=火箭发射器可以使用最多6枚无导向火箭进行毁灭性的区域轰炸，非常适合攻击设防地点。

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.guided_missile_launcher=线导导弹发射器
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.guided_missile_launcher.desc=线导导弹发射器提供远程精确打击，尤其对移动目标特别有效.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.tesla=特斯拉塔
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.emplacement.tesla.desc=特斯拉塔使用高压电摧毁其攻击半径内的敌人,对电子产品尤其有效.

#Data Input Machine
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.advanced_data=高级输入设备
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.advanced_data.desc=将转换后的打字机替换为一个真正的全电子控制面板，允许用户输入高级数据类型，如向量、映射和数组。

#Arithmetic-Logic Machine
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.memory=内置存储
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.memory.desc=增加一页内置内存用于加载和保存数据操作结果。
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.circuit_racks=附加电路机架
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.circuit_racks.desc=增加机架，允许在机器内部再安装两个电路。

#Other upgrades
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.core_filler=弹头填充
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.core_filler.desc=为弹头工坊配备一个插入器,可以精确地将所需组件填充到弹丸中。

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.packer_fluid=流体加载器
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.packer_fluid.desc=安装液体容器和一些管道.可以从容器中注入和排出液体.出于安全原因,封装机一次只能处理物品,液体或能源中的一种.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.packer_energy=能量加载器
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.packer_energy.desc=安装一对电容器和一个特斯拉线圈.可以快速为能源设备充电.出于安全原因,打包机一次只能处理物品、液体或能量中的一种.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.packer_railway=铁路改造
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.packer_railway.desc=将包装机的传送带替换为铁路轨道,从而可以装载和卸载矿车.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.packer_naming=命名戳
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.packer_naming.desc=允许包装机命名装载的容器，可以使用过滤器和数据.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.radio_locators=无线电定位器
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.radio_locators.desc=允许雷达检测无线电信号并计算其原点。增加操作所需的能量.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.rs_activation=红石激活
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.rs_activation.desc=连接一个红石接线器和一对执行器.可以用红石信号打开大门.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.razor_wire=刀片刺网
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.razor_wire.desc=在大门顶部绑上一根铁丝网,伤害任何敢于爬过去的敌人.

machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.printing_press.punchtapes=打孔纸带处理器
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.printing_press.punchtapes.desc=修改印刷机的输入进纸器以允许处理打孔纸带。
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.printing_press.batching=批处理机制
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.printing_press.batching.desc=为印刷机添加一个热风订书机，使其能够装订页面并印刷书籍和报纸。
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.printing_press.enveloper=信封机
machineupgrade.immersiveintelligence.printing_press.enveloper.desc=修改印刷机的内部结构，使其能够将单页折叠并装入信封。

