desc.immersiveintelligence.diplomacy.law_form.company.tier2=公司
desc.immersiveintelligence.diplomacy.law_form.company.tier2_long=一个拥有工厂和员工的不断发展的企业.
desc.immersiveintelligence.diplomacy.law_form.company.tier3=公司
desc.immersiveintelligence.diplomacy.law_form.company.tier3_long=一个拥有大量资产和有组织管理的强大企业实体.
desc.immersiveintelligence.diplomacy.law_form.company.tier4=企业集团
desc.immersiveintelligence.diplomacy.law_form.company.tier4_long=一个由工业,武装力量和战略资源组成的庞大帝国.
